{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近チークの色を気分で\n使い分けるのにハマってる〜〜。\nちなみに今日はピンクの気分！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n伊藤純奈です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋握手会2days\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握はみおなとペア！\n楽しかった(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\nあと日奈子がいれば塩アイスレーン\nだった！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日は個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"REDY AZELのセットアップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白のトレーナーに白のスカート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちとも全身の写真なくて\nごめんねヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋2日間楽しかったです！\n明日からは京都2日間！\n全握はゆっちゃんペア♡\nよろしくお願いいたします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握は伊織とおそろいの\n洋服を着るよ〜〜！お楽しみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndアルバム「それぞれの椅子」\n5月25日発売です(・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初の2期生曲「かき氷の片想い」\nとっても素敵な曲になっているので\nたのしみにしていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/junna.itou/img/junna.itou/img/2016/05/03/7184037/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケットのオフショット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\nおやすみなさーい！"}],"source":"archive"}